cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SCM — Motor de Velos: Environmental Modulation in Galaxy Rotation Curves"
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: software

version: "2.1.0"

abstract: >
  Motor-de-Velos-SCM provides a reproducible, auditable pipeline to evaluate
  galaxy rotation curves under the SCM (Motor de Velos; Fluid Condensation)
  model. Version 2.1.0 adds the mechanism analysis pipeline (H1/H2/H3) that
  tests dark-matter fraction, disk-size, and baryonic-mass effects as drivers
  of the environmental signal in rotation-curve tails, using N=79 SPARC
  galaxies with OLS HC3 regressions and AIC model comparison.

